{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "8a394f0e7983e2837c6a47b78eb8a2ed6a64f34db5ea04eff6538d350e099fac", "ja": "ウンババウッホッホ！☆魔法の言葉！", "zh": "嗯吧吧呜吼吼！☆魔法咒语！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "471e80d6d7b6e8e9c5c2a2e4db004ff9a10fe051796ace677ac4b9444ea64d83", "ja": "ジャングルで遊ぶ夢を見たと話す真美と環。\nそこに真と歩が来て、みんなで、『ジャング\nル☆パーティー』を踊る。楽しく踊り終わっ\nたとき、プロデューサーは、他にだれもいな\nいはずのステージに響く拍手の音を聞いた。", "zh": "真美跟环聊起在丛林游玩的梦境。\n此时真跟步也到场，\n众人跳起了『丛林☆派对』。\n快乐的共舞结束时，制作人却听见了掌声，\n回响在这场没有其他观众存在的表演中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ae13d71ab6e6b38208ffa97713d9c4a548b72de798c0c8f8da6e0ab01d20c6dc", "ja": "（地方公演は大成功に終わった！\nよくやったな、真美、環！）", "zh": "（地方公演成功落幕了！\n做得好啊，真美、环！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b55d0c2b9be47abecf67dbf3d2ce460c85bd6d59718eebda317296f9bb85dbb3", "ja": "二人とも、この前は地方公演、お疲れさま！\nこれ、差し入れのバナナだ。食べるか？", "zh": "之前的地方公演，辛苦你们了！\n这是送来慰劳你们的香蕉，要吃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "35eace36f3620fd14c6e9d14c06c8c81416750a0c82c62abe02e036ece283889", "ja": "おっ、気がきくね、兄ちゃん！\nいただきまーす！", "zh": "哦，大哥哥还满周到的嘛！\n真美开动啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "361478d7763b6a2ce66e6def5e14010da5367d5bf524f6ac30efcb48d1e4c59d", "ja": "バナナ、おいしいぞ～！　……あ。そういえば、\nこの前、ジャングルでバナナ食べる夢を見たんだ！", "zh": "香蕉好好吃喔～！啊。这么说来，\n环之前做了在丛林里吃香蕉的梦耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "96ea9e743a6787ef58680c650f3ad80c951061dcb425683553fec74dde6ef2d1", "ja": "その夢でね、あゆむと戦ったり、\nまみとターザンごっこしたりしたぞ！", "zh": "在那个梦里啊，环跟步战斗了，\n还跟真美玩了泰山游戏喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "ad451ada1d30be242d9605433ae372775fb5a2c53a9d5296641014231193cb98", "ja": "あ、真美もまこちんと勝負したり、\n世界を滅ぼそうとしたり、メッチャ楽しい夢みた！", "zh": "啊，真美也梦到跟阿真比赛，\n还有企图毁灭世界之类的，真是超级有趣的梦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "77bba567b61a949ff1714116d7ca3f6b9ad2c61b7480af53558bb656bd2e4bcf", "ja": "それは……。\n変わった夢を見たんだな。", "zh": "你们还真是……\n做了很特别的梦呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "e052d3adfe3e4f636b2f8ed8343f542a1875cfbe69d847e01afde506a9e3a3c8", "ja": "あとね、たまき、さっき劇場の前で、\nすっごくめずらしい虫をつかまえたんだぞ！", "zh": "还有啊，环刚刚在剧场前面，\n抓到了非常稀有的昆虫喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "215e663911ffda75cc6b74106612ea57563614cc6af9ad6e0cabcf62af6e7052", "ja": "その夢の中で、たまき、誰も見たことない虫が欲しい\nってお願いごとしてたんだ～。だからかも！", "zh": "环在那个梦里许愿说，希望可以得到任何人都没看过\n的昆虫～说不定就是因为这样才抓到的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6b1c387a239a3266702b670fe03094b36500ecabf259e4aa75e255508d88ffc8", "ja": "へえ、スゴいじゃないか環。\nよかったな！", "zh": "哦，环好厉害啊。\n真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "d6618701081906862d4e5cb231904b909d010f9b3b1512b64b2c39c85f6c75f0", "ja": "くふふ♪　大切に育てるぞ～！\nおやぶんにも、あとで見せてあげるね！", "zh": "呵呵♪环会用心饲养牠的喔～！\n等一下也让老大看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1011_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "ec6510a1f7fb112e9bbafb485b50341de2f5dcf58a8eb62bf4c630bfe0032a2e", "ja": "おはよう、みんな！", "zh": "大家早啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8bf91a55dce3f3eec93aba30b81d7991882598cff8f2b4e1f4c815f9928c0858", "ja": "うわっ、環たち、バナナ食べてるっ！？", "zh": "唔哇，环你们在吃香蕉！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2f9d9484ca03d114064f5000fd442bb1f8cf34006f0ec212bcfde6d4a2f7e021", "ja": "バナナがどうかしたのか？", "zh": "香蕉怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "836500439b110c6720cfedaede04117a802ecc325cd3cd5152da3adf8df7a401", "ja": "いや、なんでかわかんないけど……実はこの一週間、\n毎日バナナの皮を踏んで、転んじゃってるんだよね。", "zh": "没有，我也不知道为什么……其实最近这一周，\n我每天都会踩到香蕉皮滑倒耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d7fda0bcfe19d4c255771b9a52af9867eeeee30693900f64fa7f165df2615e03", "ja": "だから、バナナを見ると警戒しちゃってさ～。", "zh": "所以一看到香蕉就忍不住提起戒心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "168999cfe9ab5c5453799adaaae29762db3c04b3124fce258b6e896d17c3420d", "ja": "歩って結構、不運体質だよね……。", "zh": "步还真是倒楣体质啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "4381e33aaf567feaf64602c19b23c435737f17ea75ff5537e320eef953ee4036", "ja": "それはそうと、\n地方公演はどうだった、二人とも？", "zh": "先不说这个了，\n你们觉得地方公演怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "7b521b575346c9a8cb6be76b1fd38aa8c8cfb2b911c94663fe9f28c5d3bf6cb9", "ja": "サイコーだったよ！　遠くの兄ちゃんと姉ちゃん達も、\nおっきな声で応援してくれたんだー！", "zh": "超级棒的耶！远方的大哥哥跟大姊姊\n也很大声地声援真美我们～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "4d8d44eba6a41103111e857384cdfa218e3e5cf614989dfd1e44c528c199abbf", "ja": "『ジャングル☆パーティー』、\nすっごく盛り上がったぞ～！　ウンババー！", "zh": "『丛林☆派对』的气氛超级热烈的喔～！\n嗯吧吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "051c45ead5965d91b3fb82abb3ecd0e7e7c0f61b5fc4b7871147b44d00bf5af9", "ja": "ウッホッホ！", "zh": "呜吼吼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "d03379a8b8e1b6d6396872dc1cb2e2ceca499f5864bdd2d317f6d80d645a4fc4", "ja": "あはは！　なんだか聞いてるだけで、\n体がウズウズしてきたよ！", "zh": "啊哈哈！感觉光是听着，\n身体就开始蠢蠢欲动了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "607603cad3892405491035694c2f4576128aa88e3529b0e95327bf707ba5f1df", "ja": "アタシも！　思いっきり踊りたい気分！", "zh": "我也是！感觉好想尽情跳舞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "25afc1cf79f779a99fea2830b3c8de4191dd895475bc600b5eeec7318f15291f", "ja": "なら、今は舞台が空いてるし、\nステージで踊るか？", "zh": "既然这样，反正现在舞台也空着，\n要不要上台跳舞？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "520cc2e276d8b9fe9c6ac6086e361adde323024bfaf83939f1ffbd5f1ccd151f", "ja": "いいの！？　やったー♪\nみんなで踊ろー！", "zh": "可以吗！？太好了──♪\n大家一起跳舞吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1026_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e698941dbf0ad68394f503fe46b0c35893ff08f59126a17a1e70829debec7d06", "ja": "じゃあ、ステージに行こっか！", "zh": "那就到舞台上去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1027_se", "source_sha256": "0097285ca6c40e6eebc6a741e40ba866b73b4fa510a6e6c34e19d48bb2892084", "ja": "ズルッ", "zh": "（滑）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1028_034ayu", "source_sha256": "65c087165e61010b8847b9b712e5a6ec39325e856880114cedd9dbe6bfb4a99a", "ja": "あう！　……マイガーッ！？\nまたバナナの皮で転んじゃった～！", "zh": "啊呜……My God！？\n我又踩到香蕉皮滑倒了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1029_040tam", "source_sha256": "d1b6a604a37ecb65515bbeef3f8727a6da8b3bb9cc1048eed4e1ed11712a16f9", "ja": "それじゃあ、行くぞ～！\nウンババウッホッホ！", "zh": "那么要开始了喔～！\n嗯吧吧呜吼吼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1030_012mam", "source_sha256": "ecd444c852047863291e42462ae4e3eb1872ade57059598e59597b863f841dac", "ja": "ウンババウッホッホ！", "zh": "嗯吧吧呜吼吼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "ecd444c852047863291e42462ae4e3eb1872ade57059598e59597b863f841dac", "ja": "ウンババウッホッホ！", "zh": "嗯吧吧呜吼吼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1032_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ecd444c852047863291e42462ae4e3eb1872ade57059598e59597b863f841dac", "ja": "ウンババウッホッホ！", "zh": "嗯吧吧呜吼吼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1033_p", "source_sha256": "2b89c7b0a1cca449c73e3280c1a3cc0b52666299e7daaf9444f5510107e85e49", "ja": "（みんなは、とても楽しそうに\n『ジャングル☆パーティー』を踊った）", "zh": "（大家看起来非常开心，\n一起跳了『丛林☆派对』。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1034_012mam", "source_sha256": "d2cf93d69377ded502f0811399571b31095fa68fdc4981e9bbf9e13c77f56ef0", "ja": "やっぱこの曲、メッチャ面白いね！\nウンババーって感じ！　ウンババー！", "zh": "这首歌果然超级有趣耶！\n感觉很嗯吧吧──！嗯吧吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_07_1035_p", "source_sha256": "e8819480322b9ef5aac76a2efe156e0f96d7bd3da06485a3baa1801efe6ebc05", "ja": "いいステージだったよ。\n俺しか観客がいないのが、もったいないくらいだった。", "zh": "这场表演很棒喔。\n我甚至觉得，观众只有我一个人真是太可惜了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
